cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the research findings, cite the preprint below; cite this software record when referring specifically to the reproducibility artifact."
title: "EACP Operational-Provenance Artifact: Reproducible Identifier-Failure and Cross-Plane Evaluation"
abstract: >-
  Version 1.3.0 of the reproducibility artifact for a lightweight
  evidence-aware control plane. It includes an implementable evidence profile,
  an adversarial identifier-failure campaign, a paired SQLite index ablation,
  preserved failed and confirmatory GitHub Actions-to-Kubernetes cohorts across
  three Kubernetes minor versions, and the version 1.2 Kubernetes and
  OpenTelemetry baselines. The accompanying manuscript is a non-peer-reviewed
  preprint. The DOI in this record identifies the artifact, not the accompanying
  article. Licensing is file-scoped; see LICENSES/README.md and paper/README.md.
